WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:04.000
Showly. Every buyer tour, captured.

00:04.500 --> 00:09.000
It lives inside ONE Brain, with every tour and every answer.

00:09.500 --> 00:13.600
One tour per showing day. Start it in the car.

00:14.100 --> 00:18.800
Snap the listing sheet. Showly fills in the details.

00:19.300 --> 00:24.000
Talk as you walk through, with their okay. Tap what they liked.

00:24.500 --> 00:28.800
Showly drafts the write-up. You read it first.

00:29.300 --> 00:33.600
One recap for the whole tour, sent by text.

00:34.100 --> 00:38.800
Your buyer answers every home: yes, maybe or no.

00:39.300 --> 00:43.600
See their answers the moment they land.

00:44.100 --> 00:48.600
Learn what they want, and what they're approved to.

00:49.100 --> 00:53.600
Ask the lender for a letter, right from the home.

00:54.100 --> 00:58.600
Coming soon: a yes becomes ONE's next step for you.

00:59.100 --> 01:03.800
Showly. Every buyer tour. Part of ONE.
